note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/arest-cache.om: arcache (gpu/nvidia/om/apirest/cache.om); Q is its 8 q words, the key word (its 4 low bytes, little-endian, are the key) and 17 records of 8 bytes, each word the record's bytes little-endian (the test's struct: valid, pinned, 2 pad, a 4-byte key). Composed before arest.om.
text t_name "AREST-CACHE"
text t_au "cache"
note the 17 records from word s of q, 8 bytes each, little-endian
fn arrec q view ulong 64 s ulong x edit uchar 136 to void
for i ulong 17
w = get q add s i
c = mul i 8
for b ulong 8
put x add c b uchar and shr w mul b 8 255
end
end
end
fn arop q view ulong 64 nq ulong ny ulong o edit ulong 128 to ulong
if or ne nq 26 ne ny 0
ckbad
end
a = new ulong 8 0
for i ulong 8
put a i get q i
end
key = new uchar 4 0
for b ulong 4
put key b uchar and shr get q 8 mul b 8 255
end
x = new uchar 136 0
arrec q 9 x
ret arcache a x key
end
